# Phase 7 baseline manifest
# Deterministic file list (LC_ALL=C path-sorted) with SHA-256 hashes over the committed Git blob content (not the
# Windows checkout bytes), covering the complete Phase 7 implementation baseline set: the timing production sources
# (anticheat-player: TimingEvent, RttEstimator, MarkerLedger, TimingLedger; anticheat-simulation: TimingRequest,
# TimingBudget, TimingHypothesis, TimingResolution, TimingResolver, TimingReconstruction; anticheat-core:
# TimingObservationMapper, MarkerPort, TimingTracer, TimingStatus, TimingEngineStatus and the PacketEngine timing hooks;
# anticheat-version: TimingProfile and the P7-F8 LowPrecisionVector; anticheat-platform-paper: PaperMarkerPort and the
# /papea2ac timing command wiring), the P7-F1..P7-F9 forward-correction production files (PacketEngine,
# PlayerObservationMapper, the P7-F2 AbstractTransfer landing envelope, ReconstructionRequest.MAX_BRANCHES), tests
# (resolver, ledger, property, fuzz, velocity/teleport round trips, fixtures, observation mapper, marker scheduling,
# coverage, tracer, the AbstractTransferTest and ArchitectureTest additions), native tests (ACK inventory, LpVec3
# differential), TimingBenchmarks, the memory/fixture harnesses, Gradle task changes, the Phase 7 report, the human
# approval record, and the artifacts (ack inventory, RTT model, timing round-trip, velocity, teleport, fuzz, timing
# fixtures, benchmarks (final-code run), memory results, verification.json, and the real-client evidence log).
